# AURA Desktop — example environment
#
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and adjust as needed. NONE of these are required
# for a normal build/run; they only cover development and test overrides.
#
# NOTE: your Anthropic API key is NOT configured here. BYOK lives in a 0600 file
# at ~/.aura/anthropic_api_key (shared with the `aura` CLI) and is managed from
# the in-app Settings — never commit a key to this repo.

# Host the Vite dev server binds to when developing the Tauri mobile targets.
# Read by app/vite.config.ts. Leave unset for normal desktop `tauri dev`.
# TAURI_DEV_HOST=192.168.1.10

# Override the `~/.aura` home directory (key file, run scratch). Used mainly to
# isolate the app from a real user profile in tests. Read by src-tauri/apikey.rs.
# AURA_RUNS_DIR_HOME=/tmp/aura-test-home
